OL,3,GNEWSADriver hurt as car crashes into
OL,4,Ahouse's front room
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was left with potentially serious
OL,7,Finjuries after a car smashed into the
OL,8,Ffront room of a house and ended up on
OL,9,Fits roof, an ambulance service has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service was
OL,13,Fcalled to a house on Canal View, Chirk
OL,14,FBank, Shropshire at 22:01 GMT on
OL,15,FSaturday, with fire crews following at
OL,16,Fabout 22:20 GMT.
OL,18,FThe man, the driver of the car, was
OL,19,Ftreated at the scene and then taken to
OL,20,Fthe Royal Shrewsbury Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
